stormnic-i40e
=============

An original Rust implementation, licensed MIT (see LICENSE).

Acknowledgement: the hardware facts in docs/hardware.md (register offsets
and fields, the reset sequence, the admin-queue protocol and commands, the
HMC and queue-context layouts, descriptor formats) were learned from Intel's
shared code for the 700 series as published in FreeBSD sys/dev/ixl
(BSD-3-Clause, commit 4b732459f030). iPXE's intelxl.c (GPL) was read for
behaviour only. No source code was copied; the driver is a rewrite, and
docs/hardware.md describes the hardware in its own words.
